      "writtenOn": "2026-08-17T12:06:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we locate TCP using the L4 offset computed by the SFDP parser and validate the header bounds? Adding fixed IPv4/IPv6 header sizes interprets IPv4 options or IPv6 extension headers as TCP, producing invalid TCP/RTT statistics and potentially reading beyond the valid header.",
